WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:05.520
Hey, David, whatever happened to Donald Trump's
wall and does it matter for 2020?

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.549
So all you need to know is that Trump is claiming
he did it.

00:00:10.549 --> 00:00:11.719
Trump is claiming he did it.

00:00:11.719 --> 00:00:16.090
Now, you might remember when he was running,
Trump's promise was by the end of my first

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:21.640
term, we'll have a wall across the entire
u.s.-mexico border that was never going to

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:22.640
happen.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:23.650
Trump also said Mexico would pay for it.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.330
That was never going to happen, and none of
it has happened.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:35.510
Trump has been able to finagle getting about
looks like 150, 160 miles of wall starting

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:39.440
to be built, some of which will be completed
by November.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:44.251
But what you need to understand is, despite
that obviously being a failure by Donald Trump

00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:49.280
to do what he promised to do, he's going to
claim victory and a lot of his followers are

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.370
going to fall for it.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:51.850
So, first of all.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:57.149
There will be very little fact checking of
Trump about you promised a wall across the

00:00:57.149 --> 00:00:59.609
entire border what the hell happened.

00:00:59.609 --> 00:01:04.729
If it happens, Trump will say, listen, Democrats
got in the way.

00:01:04.729 --> 00:01:07.159
Corona virus got in the way.

00:01:07.159 --> 00:01:09.030
And I built what I was able to do.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:11.250
If it weren't for Democrats, I would have
built the whole thing.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.870
But we've had a huge success.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:15.400
We have 150 miles, bill or whatever.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.400
And I did everything I could.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.400
And it is a victory.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.049
We have more miles now than we ever had before.

00:01:20.049 --> 00:01:21.049
You all get it right.

00:01:21.049 --> 00:01:23.360
So he's going to claim victory no matter what.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:24.770
And that is all that matters.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.640
Optics is all that matters.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:32.930
It is this bizarre, sort of like raw shock
test of a wedge issue.

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:38.409
I had people calling me on live calls a year
and a half ago, two years ago.

00:01:38.409 --> 00:01:42.650
There's this crazy Republican caller, Doug,
who sometimes calls and he's from Southern

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:44.109
California.

00:01:44.109 --> 00:01:47.590
And he was saying, the wall, the wall, the
wall, the wall.

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:51.009
And I said, well, if Trump doesn't build the
wall during his first term, will you still

00:01:51.009 --> 00:01:53.000
vote for him for reelection?

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:57.799
And he basically said probably, which means
that it doesn't really matter if he builds

00:01:57.799 --> 00:02:03.010
the wall, even just claiming to have succeeded
despite the oppression of Democrats on the

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.200
wall.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.270
Most Trump ists are going to vote for him
anyway because they see Biden as worse.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:13.739
It's an incoherent explanation that Corona
virus and Democrats prevented him from from

00:02:13.739 --> 00:02:15.269
building it.

00:02:15.269 --> 00:02:18.560
Republicans have also gotten the way of giving
him the funding that he wants.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:19.989
We've talked about all of that.

00:02:19.989 --> 00:02:26.530
But the 2020 election is going to be primarily
a referendum on the state of the economy at

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:30.700
the time and what that means about Trump's
management of the country.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:35.830
Of course, it will be affected by Corona virus,
but Trump's actual handling of the virus itself

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.950
is mostly baked in already.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:45.569
It will be a matter of do we have a sort of
ad between the waves that helps Trump in November

00:02:45.569 --> 00:02:46.569
or not?

00:02:46.569 --> 00:02:49.799
I don't believe that the wall is going to
be a factor in any way.

00:02:49.799 --> 00:02:53.599
People who are against the wall are probably
already not voting for Trump.

00:02:53.599 --> 00:02:58.750
People who are who voted for Trump in 2016
and hear him say, we did it.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:01.640
I made one hundred and fifty miles and will
do more my second term.

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:02.640
They're gonna fall for it.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:05.230
I do not believe it's going to make a difference
if you disagree with me.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.480
I, of course, want to hear from you.

